{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212270","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1121227001:0":{"text":"雅顿贤者看了蕾米雅的信后放心不下，于是叫上了我来接你们。","source_cn":"雅顿贤者看了蕾米雅的信后放心不下，于是叫上了我来接你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4822F1A361E647F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121227002:1":{"text":"她的确和阿露拉那孩子长得一模一样。","source_cn":"她的确和阿露拉那孩子长得一模一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD20770CB8309E09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121227003:1":{"text":"阿露拉属于<style=\"highlight\">告雨</style>一族，好几年前我在瓦度索隐居时认识了她。","source_cn":"阿露拉属于<style=highlight>告雨</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC732F068874A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121227004:1":{"text":"我听说过，那一族对自然环境的变化尤为敏锐。","source_cn":"我听说过，那一族对自然环境的变化尤为敏锐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6AFD1969F68450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121227005:1":{"text":"没错，他们的族长甚至早就预知到了腐化会为薄暮丛林和瓦度索山脉带来灾难。","source_cn":"没错，他们的族长甚至早就预知到了腐化会为薄暮丛林和瓦度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4223C78DE6779602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121227006:0":{"text":"阿尔法十一在港口预知了暴雨将至！雅顿贤者，她果然就是阿露拉本人吗？","source_cn":"阿尔法十一在港口预知了暴雨将至！雅顿贤者，她果然就是阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB20ADA3754BDD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121227007:0":{"text":"是不是呢……虽然外貌很像，但是她们给我的感觉并不相同。","source_cn":"是不是呢……虽然外貌很像，但是她们给我的感觉并不相同。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B20A33D74AC975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121227008:0":{"text":"雅顿贤者，我打算直接带阿尔法十一去找她的族人。","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，我打算直接带阿尔法十一去找她的族人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC25E44FE930C9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121227009:1":{"text":"你能顺利找到吗？告雨一族他们向来行踪不定，很少与外族联系。","source_cn":"你能顺利找到吗？告雨一族他们向来行踪不定，很少与外族联系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE5530DE38D24B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121227010:1":{"text":"但我可以告诉你的是，他们居住在瓦度索山脉的中部地区，那边有不少隐蔽的洞穴。","source_cn":"但我可以告诉你的是，他们居住在瓦度索山脉的中部地区，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3008A268C24E7A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_statu